---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config';

const description = 'How Embedded Consultants LLC in Novi Sad handles inquiries, bookings and cookieless analytics.';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description={description} image="/og/og-privacy.png">
  <main id="main" class="page">
    <div class="wrap article-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lead">What this site collects, why, and who to write to. No cookies for advertising.</p>
      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:28px">
        <p>
          Embedded Consultants LLC is the controller for this website. Headquarters: Novi Sad, Serbia.
          Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
        </p>
        <h2>The project form</h2>
        <p>
          If you write to us through the form, we receive your name, email address, company if you give one,
          the stage you select (idea, prototype or production) and the description you write. We use that only
          to reply, and to carry on the conversation if we work together.
        </p>
        <p>
          The form is handled by Formspree, which emails the inquiry to us. Formspree processes it on our behalf.
          A hidden field is there to catch automated spam. We do not use reCAPTCHA.
        </p>
        <h2>A booked call</h2>
        <p>
          The “30-min free call” link opens a calendar booking page when that link is connected, and otherwise
          opens your email app. We do not embed a calendar script on this site. If you book a time, the calendar
          provider processes the time and the email address you enter so the call can happen.
        </p>
        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use Umami Cloud (<a href="https://cloud.umami.is">cloud.umami.is</a>). The script is loaded with
          <code>defer</code> from <code>https://cloud.umami.is/script.js</code>. Umami does not set a cookie and
          is not used for advertising. It counts page views and a few events, such as a click on the booking
          link or the form. It does not receive your name. There is no Google Analytics tag on this site.
        </p>
        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          Inquiry emails stay for as long as we need them to reply and to keep a record of the work.
          Email us if you want a copy, a correction, or for the inquiry to be deleted.
        </p>
        <h2>We do not sell personal information</h2>
        <p>We do not sell or rent the details you send. We do not put a person’s name on this website.</p>
        <p>Updated 17 November 2026.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
